cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this case study, please cite it as below."
title: "Sequence-based karyotype inference and simulated C-banding/FISH for Capra hircus"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Alejo Herrador"
    given-names: "Tiago"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Capra hircus
  - karyotype
  - C-banding
  - FISH
  - simulation
  - satellite DNA
abstract: >-
  A personal portfolio case study. It infers the karyotype and the expected heteromorphisms of
  goat chromosomes from centromere tables derived from public assemblies, and simulates C-banding
  and FISH measurements to ask which cytogenetic designs could detect those differences.
  All cytogenetic data are simulated. Code under MIT; text and figures under CC BY 4.0.
